---
import Logo from './Logo.astro';
import NewsletterSignup from './NewsletterSignup.astro';

const year = 2026;

const cols = [
  {
    title: 'Markets',
    links: [
      { href: '/deals', label: 'Deal screener' },
      { href: '/deals?type=crowdfunding', label: 'Crowdfunding' },
      { href: '/deals?type=secondary', label: 'Secondaries' },
      { href: '/deals?type=pre-ipo', label: 'Pre-IPO' },
      { href: '/portfolio', label: 'Build my portfolio' },
    ],
  },
  {
    title: 'Platform',
    links: [
      { href: '/how-it-works', label: 'How it works' },
      { href: '/portfolio-intelligence', label: 'Portfolio Intelligence' },
      { href: '/ai-engine', label: 'The AI Engine' },
      { href: '/trust', label: 'Trust & Safety' },
      { href: '/pricing', label: 'Pricing' },
    ],
  },
  {
    title: 'Founders',
    links: [
      { href: '/founders', label: 'For Founders' },
      { href: '/founders#health-check', label: 'AI Pitch Health Check' },
      { href: '/founders#apply', label: 'Apply to raise' },
    ],
  },
  {
    title: 'Learn',
    links: [
      { href: '/learn', label: 'Academy' },
      { href: '/blog', label: 'Insights' },
      { href: '/legal/risk-warning', label: 'Risk warnings' },
      { href: '/brand', label: 'Brand' },
    ],
  },
  {
    title: 'Company',
    links: [
      { href: '/about', label: 'About' },
      { href: '/careers', label: 'Careers' },
      { href: '/contact', label: 'Contact' },
      { href: '/accessibility', label: 'Accessibility' },
      { href: '/login', label: 'Log in' },
    ],
  },
];
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="risk-band" role="note" aria-label="Risk warning">
    <div class="container">
      <p>
        <strong>Don't invest unless you're prepared to lose all the money you
        invest.</strong> This is a high-risk investment and you are unlikely to be
        protected if something goes wrong.
        <a href="/legal/risk-warning">Take 2 minutes to learn more</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container footer-main">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <a href="/" aria-label="Bundle.ai home"><Logo size={26} tone="white" /></a>
      <p class="tagline">
        Every private-market deal, crowdfunding, secondaries and pre-IPO, on
        one screen. Compare across venues, then invest where the deal lives.
      </p>
      <p class="made-in">
        Designed and built in the United Kingdom.<br />
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a> ·
        <a href="https://x.com" rel="noopener">X</a> ·
        <a href="mailto:hello@bundle.ai">hello@bundle.ai</a>
      </p>
    </div>

    <nav class="footer-cols" aria-label="Footer">
      {
        cols.map((col) => (
          <div class="footer-col">
            <h3>{col.title}</h3>
            <ul>
              {col.links.map((l) => (
                <li>
                  <a href={l.href}>{l.label}</a>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </nav>
  </div>

  <div class="container footer-news">
    <hr class="hr" />
    <div class="news-grid">
      <div class="news-copy">
        <p class="news-kicker">The Bundle briefing</p>
        <p class="news-sub">
          Twice a month: new venues added, what changed in the UK rules, and the
          occasional Academy piece. No deal pushes. Unsubscribe in one click.
        </p>
      </div>
      <NewsletterSignup variant="footer" source="footer" id="nl-footer" />
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container footer-legal">
    <hr class="hr" />
    <p class="legal-copy">
      Bundle Technologies Ltd ("Bundle.ai") is a technology company, not a broker.
      Bundle.ai is an aggregator: it surfaces and compares opportunities listed
      on third-party venues and routes you to those venues to invest. Bundle does not hold client money or client assets, does not
      execute trades, and does not currently arrange, promote or facilitate
      investments. Deals, prices and statistics shown on this site are
      indicative figures sourced from the venues’ own public pages at a stated
      date; they are not live quotes or offers, and links to venues open the
      venue’s site under its own terms and eligibility rules. Where future
      services constitute regulated activities, they will be offered only when
      the appropriate FCA authorisations, or partnerships with authorised firms,
      are in place. Venue names appear to identify where opportunities of each
      kind are listed and do not imply partnership or endorsement. Nothing on
      this site is investment advice, a personal recommendation, or a financial
      promotion of any specific investment. Investing in startups and private
      companies involves significant risk, including total loss of capital and
      illiquidity. Tax treatment depends on individual circumstances and may
      change.
    </p>
    <div class="legal-row">
      <span>© {year} Bundle Technologies Ltd. All rights reserved.</span>
      <span class="legal-links">
        <a href="/legal/risk-warning">Risk warnings</a>
        <a href="/legal/terms">Terms</a>
        <a href="/legal/privacy">Privacy</a>
        <a href="/legal/cookies">Cookies</a>
        <a href="/legal/data-deletion">Delete my data</a>
        <a href="/legal/refunds">Refunds</a>
        <a href="/accessibility">Accessibility</a>
        <button type="button" class="legal-btn" data-cookie-prefs>
          Cookie preferences
        </button>
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  /* Primary Dark surface: the anchor at the bottom of every page. */
  .site-footer {
    position: relative;
    margin-top: auto;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: #c9d6c9;
  }

  .risk-band {
    background: rgba(201, 162, 39, 0.12);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201, 162, 39, 0.22);
  }

  .risk-band p {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.85rem 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #e6ecdf;
  }

  .risk-band strong {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .risk-band a {
    color: var(--gold);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
    font-weight: 550;
  }

  .footer-main {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 2.85fr;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    padding-block: clamp(2.75rem, 5vw, 4rem) 2rem;
  }

  .tagline {
    margin-top: 1.1rem;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: #a8bba8;
    max-width: 24rem;
  }

  .made-in {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #a8bba8;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .made-in a {
    color: var(--gold);
  }

  .made-in a:hover {
    color: #ddbb4f;
  }

  .footer-legal .hr {
    border-top-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  }

  .footer-cols {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .footer-col h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #8fa48f;
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
  }

  .footer-col ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .footer-col a {
    color: #c9d6c9;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  .footer-col a:hover {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .footer-legal {
    padding-bottom: 2.25rem;
  }

  .legal-copy {
    padding-top: 1.75rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: #8fa48f;
    max-width: 68rem;
  }

  .legal-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: #8fa48f;
  }

  .footer-news { padding-bottom: 0.5rem; }

  .news-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.25fr;
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    align-items: start;
    padding-top: 1.75rem;
  }

  .news-kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #8fa48f;
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
  }

  .news-sub {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #a8bba8;
    max-width: 26rem;
  }

  .legal-links {
    display: inline-flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  /* Reopening consent is a dialog, not a page, so it is a button. It is
     styled as the links beside it because that is what it behaves like. */
  .legal-btn {
    border: 0;
    background: none;
    padding: 0;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: inherit;
    color: #a8bba8;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .legal-btn:hover { color: #ffffff; }

  .legal-links a {
    color: #a8bba8;
  }

  .legal-links a:hover {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .footer-main {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .footer-cols {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      row-gap: 2rem;
    }

    .news-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .footer-cols {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
